  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Саундбар Polk Audio Signa S3 — Two-piece sound-bar system with a wireless subwoofer.</p>\n<ul><li>System: Sound bar with wireless subwoofer; 2 total pieces</li><li>Frequency response: 45 Hz–20 kHz</li><li>Sound-bar drivers: 2 × 1.25 × 4.4 in (32 × 112 mm) oval drivers and 2 </li><li>Subwoofer: 1 × 5.25 in ported wireless subwoofer</li><li>Inputs and wireless connectivity: HDMI ARC, Toslink optical, AUX 3.5 m</li></ul>\n<h2>Характеристики</h2>\n<p><strong>System</strong>: Sound bar with wireless subwoofer; 2 total pieces · <strong>Frequency response</strong>: 45 Hz–20 kHz · <strong>Sound-bar drivers</strong>: 2 × 1.25 × 4.4 in (32 × 112 mm) oval drivers and 2 × 1 in (25 mm) tweeters · <strong>Subwoofer</strong>: 1 × 5.25 in ported wireless subwoofer · <strong>Inputs and wireless connectivity</strong>: HDMI ARC, Toslink optical, AUX 3.5 mm, Chromecast built-in, and Bluetooth · <strong>Audio decoding</strong>: Dolby Digital 5.1 decoding · <strong>Sound-bar dimensions</strong>: 35.37 W × 2.12 H × 3.25 D in (898 × 56 × 83 mm) · <strong>Subwoofer dimensions</strong>: 7.4 W × 14.5 H × 14.4 D in (171 × 311 × 343 mm).</p>\n<p>Includes Polk VoiceAdjust technology for clearer dialogue.</p>",
